    "   then supplies `score()` (the $R^2$), and we will ask for the MSE\n",
    "   explicitly.\n",
    "\n",
    "Fill in `fit` and `predict` around your own network (the `...` lines).\n",
    "Nothing else in this notebook depends on how your network is written."
