    "## Exercise 4 (optional): the loop by hand, reproducing scikit-learn exactly\n",
    "\n",
    "The exercise notebook already contains a worked version with its own fold\n",
    "indices passed to `scikit-learn` as `cv=folds`. Here we go one step\n",
