    "*itself*: `KFold` draws its permutation from the legacy generator\n",
    "`np.random.RandomState(2026)` and cuts it into $k$ contiguous blocks (the\n",
    "first $n\\bmod k$ one sample larger), so the same two lines give the same\n",
    "folds, and the hand-written loop — scaler fitted on the training part,\n",
    "the network trained from scratch, the validation MSE recorded — must then\n",
    "return the five numbers of exercise 2a, not merely their mean."
